* ============================================================
* CircuitGen - Low Noise Amplifier (LNA) front end
* ------------------------------------------------------------
* Frequency : 2.4 GHz
* Targets   : Av >= 15 dB, NF <= 1.34 dB, Zin/Zout = 50 ohm
* Supply    : 3.3 V single rail
*
* Device (ASSUMED BFP420-class NPN - substitute real datasheet):
*   Ic = 1.5 mA, gm = 58.0 mS, r_pi = 2.07 kohm,
*   C_pi = 1.5 pF, r_bb = 20 ohm, r_o = 30 kohm, F_min = 0.9 dB
*
* Input network (OPTIMISED for 50 ohm source match):
*   C_pad = 0.95 pF (source shunt), L_sig = 8.56 nH (series)
*   -> S11 = -20 dB @ 2.4 GHz, NF = 1.34 dB
*      (F_min 0.90 dB + 0.44 dB mismatch penalty)
*
* Output network (OPTIMISED PI, gain + conjugate match):
*   C_o1 = 0.97 pF, L_out = 5.44 nH, C_o2 = 4.93 pF
*   -> Av = 15.0 dB, S22 = -30 dB @ 2.4 GHz
*
* Bias (computed, ASSUMED V_BE = 0.85 V):
*   R_E = 330 ohm, R_B1 = 16k (VCC->base), R_B2 = 11k (base->GND)
*   Rth = 6.4 kohm -> bias loading factor 0.25 (re-check in SPICE)
*
* Simulated with tools/netlist_sim.py (MNA AC solver).
* ============================================================

* --- Supply rails ---
VTH   SRC 0 DC 0 AC 1
VCC   VCC 0 DC 3.3

* --- 50 ohm source ---
RSRC  SRC SRC1 50

* --- Input network (optimised 50 ohm match) ---
CPAD  SRC1 0 0.95p
LSIG  SRC1 NI 8.56n

* --- LNA device: linearized small-signal model (ASSUMED) ---
RB    BINT NI 20
RPI   BINT NE 2068
CPI   BINT NE 1.5p
GM    NC NE BINT NE 0.058
RO    NC NE 30k

* --- Bias network ---
RE    NE 0 330
CE    NE 0 10u
RB1   NI VCC 16k
RB2   NI 0 11k

* --- Output gain-match PI network (optimised) ---
CO1   NC 0 0.97p
LOUT  NC NO2 5.44n
CO2   NO2 0 4.93p

* --- Load: antenna feed, 50 ohm ---
RL    NO2 0 50

* --- Supply decoupling ---
CDP   VCC 0 100n
CHP   VCC 0 0.1u

* --- Analysis ---
.ac dec 50 1Meg 10Gig

.end